{"title":"Isabelle Li","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Isabelle Li","format":{"html":{"toc":false}}},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"hero-section\">\n  <div class=\"hero-text\">\n    <h1 class=\"hero-name\">Isabelle Li</h1>\n    <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Master's Student in Urban Spatial Analytics<br>at the University of Pennsylvania</p>\n    <div class=\"social-links\">\n      <a href=\"mailto:isabli@upenn.edu\" title=\"Email\" aria-label=\"Email\">\n        <i class=\"bi bi-envelope-fill\"></i>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/isabellelii\" title=\"LinkedIn\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Isabelliiii\" title=\"GitHub\" aria-label=\"GitHub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hero-bio\">I'm a master's student in <strong>Spatial Analytics</strong> with a background in mathematics and economics, focusing on <strong>how data can inform real-world decisions</strong>. Through urban data science projects, I've developed experience working with spatial datasets, building analytical pipelines, and translating complex data into <strong>clear, actionable insights</strong>.</p>\n    <p class=\"hero-bio\">I'm particularly interested in the <strong>intersection of data and product</strong> — using data not just to analyze, but to <strong>support decision-making, improve systems, and design user-facing tools</strong>. My work often involves thinking about both the <strong>technical side</strong> (data processing, analysis, visualization) and the <strong>user side</strong> (how insights are delivered and used).</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-photo-wrap\">\n    <img src=\"photo.jpg\" class=\"profile-photo\" alt=\"Isabelle Li\">\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"projects-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"projects-heading\">Selected Projects</h2>\n\n  <!-- PRODUCT -->\n  <p class=\"category-label\">Product</p>\n  <div class=\"project-grid\">\n    <div class=\"project-card no-link\">\n      <div class=\"project-card-preview preview-product\">\n        <span class=\"preview-badge\">PRODUCT</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"project-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"project-card-title\">Tree Planting Decision System</p>\n        <p class=\"project-card-desc\">A data-driven tool for optimising urban tree placement to maximise environmental and community benefit. <em>Coming soon.</em></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- VISUALIZATION -->\n  <p class=\"category-label\">Visualization</p>\n  <div class=\"project-grid\">\n    <a href=\"visualization.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n      <div class=\"project-card-preview preview-viz\">\n        <span class=\"preview-badge\">VISUALIZATION</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"project-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"project-card-title\">Data Visualizations</p>\n        <p class=\"project-card-desc\">A collection of charts, maps, and visual explorations from urban and spatial datasets. <em>Coming soon.</em></p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- PROJECTS -->\n  <p class=\"category-label\">Projects</p>\n  <div class=\"project-grid\">\n    <a href=\"Projects/Fire%20Alarm%20Prediction/fire-alarm-preview.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n      <div class=\"project-card-preview preview-fire\">\n        <span class=\"preview-badge\">ANALYSIS</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"project-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"project-card-title\">Fire Alarm Prediction</p>\n        <p class=\"project-card-desc\">Predicting false fire alarms in Philadelphia using spatial and socioeconomic data with machine learning in R.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"Projects/Philadelphia%20Housing%20Model/housing-preview.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n      <div class=\"project-card-preview preview-housing\">\n        <span class=\"preview-badge\">MODELLING</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"project-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"project-card-title\">Philadelphia Housing Model</p>\n        <p class=\"project-card-desc\">Spatial modelling of residential property values using census and property assessment data for Philadelphia.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT -->\n  <p class=\"category-label\">Community Engagement</p>\n  <div class=\"project-grid\">\n    <a href=\"Community%20Engagement/EPCDB/EPCDB.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n      <div class=\"project-card-preview preview-community\">\n        <span class=\"preview-badge\">ENGAGEMENT</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"project-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"project-card-title\">East Parkside Applied Case</p>\n        <p class=\"project-card-desc\">Community outreach and data-informed planning support for the East Parkside Community Development Board.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"Community%20Engagement/Published%20Writing-NAMUN.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n      <div class=\"project-card-preview preview-writing\">\n        <span class=\"preview-badge\">WRITING</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"project-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"project-card-title\">Published Writing – NAMUN</p>\n        <p class=\"project-card-desc\">Articles on international crisis reporting ethics and conference insights from NAMUN 2024.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- RESEARCH -->\n  <p class=\"category-label\">Research</p>\n  <div class=\"project-grid\">\n    <a href=\"https://uxiaoo22.github.io/python/part1.html\" class=\"project-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <div class=\"project-card-preview preview-research\">\n        <span class=\"preview-badge\">RESEARCH</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"project-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"project-card-title\">Elephant Habitat Suitability</p>\n        <p class=\"project-card-desc\">Spatial modelling of elephant habitat suitability across Southeast Asia using remote sensing and GIS.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"hero-section\">\n  <div class=\"hero-text\">\n    <h1 class=\"hero-name\">Isabelle Li</h1>\n    <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Master's Student in Urban Spatial Analytics<br>at the University of Pennsylvania</p>\n    <div class=\"social-links\">\n      <a href=\"mailto:isabli@upenn.edu\" title=\"Email\" aria-label=\"Email\">\n        <i class=\"bi bi-envelope-fill\"></i>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/isabellelii\" title=\"LinkedIn\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Isabelliiii\" title=\"GitHub\" aria-label=\"GitHub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hero-bio\">I'm a master's student in <strong>Spatial Analytics</strong> with a background in mathematics and economics, focusing on <strong>how data can inform real-world decisions</strong>. Through urban data science projects, I've developed experience working with spatial datasets, building analytical pipelines, and translating complex data into <strong>clear, actionable insights</strong>.</p>\n    <p class=\"hero-bio\">I'm particularly interested in the <strong>intersection of data and product</strong> — using data not just to analyze, but to <strong>support decision-making, improve systems, and design user-facing tools</strong>. My work often involves thinking about both the <strong>technical side</strong> (data processing, analysis, visualization) and the <strong>user side</strong> (how insights are delivered and used).</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-photo-wrap\">\n    <img src=\"photo.jpg\" class=\"profile-photo\" alt=\"Isabelle Li\">\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"projects-section\">\n  <h2 cl